Subject: CPMS I03E1 Coverage Obligation Compiler SJS Input Audit

@ [audit_uuid] 6b29e5b2-fe6a-4d8b-9dd9-465b6925ecd3
@ [source_uuid] bd2235ee-9e4f-40b1-b5d1-6723f7d9536c
@ [source_sha256] 4D2F24F9BACE80DA790B73E14F5C7DF7F7DAA9C6A70896DB3EDCFDA99D1A414A

& [AuthorityInput] is sufficient for formation only
  + exact source artifacts and schema identities are measured
  + read-only grammar-aware counts are observations rather than generated authority
  + no executable obligation catalogue exists

& [Correction1] distinguishes schema grammar from represented domain language
  + property-map keys are domain field names
  + only direct members of a schema node can be classified as schema keywords
  + raw key counting is forbidden as proof

& [Correction2] distinguishes physical and canonical identity
  + root-qualified physical rule sites preserve current document authority
  + content-equivalent canonical definitions permit template analysis
  + canonical equivalence never merges root obligations or intended use

& [Correction3] closes reference expansion
  + dollar ref creates one edge obligation at its physical site
  + the target retains its own stable rule sites
  + the compiler records reachability without recursively cloning target obligations

& [Correction4] qualifies typed divergence
  + source structure can nominate duplicate-set range option and direction candidates
  + only later I03D execution can verify actual typed behavior
  + candidates are not findings or agreement outcomes

& [Correction5] handles ignored formats
  + format annotations remain recorded
  + I03D validate-formats false means they create no schema assertion
  + typed int64 uint32 and uint64 destinations create separate representation obligations

& [Correction6] prevents impossible output comparisons
  + output typed evidence begins from actual values and serialization
  + a malformed or impossible response byte mutation can be schema-only but not typed-common unless an actual value emits it

& [Correction7] separates obligation from case
  + obligation compiler output contains targets and edges only
  + case expectations mappings observations findings coverage and pass belong to later I03E stages

& [Correction8] keeps counts provisional until signed compiler replay
  + formation records exact audited baseline counts
  + authoritative obligation counts require deterministic compiler output and independent reconstruction after activation

& [AuditDisposition] is source_valid_after_refinement_formation_allowed_implementation_forbidden
